  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting HIV Self Testing for Young Men in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an Official Development Assistance (ODA) funded UKaid project from the Department of Health and Social Care (DHSC). The project will focus on young men in Kenya aged 20 to 34 years old and aims to: Make HIV self-testing (HIVST) kits easy to get hold of and use; Motivate young men to use HIVST kits; Distribute 100,000 HIVST kits in Kenya; Encourage those who are HIV positive to get support and treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
